      "writtenOn": "2023-11-30T19:49:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about including `intel_altmode_post_event(INTEL_ALTMODE_EVENT_FORCE)` inside `resume_pd_task`? That way we can avoid exporting this.",
